\item \textbf{Analysis of Benchmarks, Performance Trends, and Practical Challenges}:
The paper provides a critical analysis of benchmarks, performance trends, and practical challenges in stance detection. It curates and compares over 30 datasets, including P-STANCE, VaxxStance, and MAWQIF, spanning multiple languages and modalities. Performance benchmarking reveals F1-macro scores of several stance detection datasets. The paper also identifies limitations such as implicit stance expression, cultural biases in training data, and the computational costs of LLMs. This evaluation helps researchers select models suited for specific use cases and highlights underexplored areas like low-resource language adaptation.
% \item \textbf{Practical Guidance}: We provide actionable insights into the practical deployment of LLMs for stance detection by analyzing various architecture types. Each architecture is assessed in terms of performance, computational efficiency, data requirements, and adaptability to different stance detection settings. 
