This is because for scenarios without eavesdropping CSI, like SDMA, Scheme 1 also uses extra signals to complete the sensing and thus cannot reduce the NPC of the considered system.
Furthermore, the difference between SDMA and Scheme 1 is the common stream in Scheme 1 is utilized as AN, and the results demonstrate that \textbf{compared with BF, the effect of AN on improvement security can be ignored}, which also is demonstrated in Figs. \ref{fig06b}-\ref{fig06d}.


