		$n_{var}^b (n_{var}^w)$ & Number of variables under optimal (worst) case after applying HAQA\\
		$n_{cons}^b (n_{cons}^w)$ & Number of constraints under optimal (worst) case after applying HAQA\\
		$n_{clause}^b (n_{clause}^w)$ & Number of clauses under optimal (worst) case after applying HAQA\\
